  "structural_change": "S81-SLICE (stream 0cm, owner-approved DV p4): new control-plane sub-leaf (centre leaf, C1 master, 14 per die) of the distributed-vector slice; flop-first pins, die hold budget; pin-bound square outline (7.8k pins, <= 6/um on full faces). XR2 (10-17, after EARLY_FAIL_SETUP -611 ps / 9.3k endpoints of 1dd564c6f): classify stage (+1 cycle on CTL / RD / lo / V / SC) registers the source select, CTL payload, RD row pairs and decoded per-target / per-leaf enables before any wide write (was one cycle E/N pin flop -> 1.1k-bit select -> 5x1024 unpacker enables); keep port registers for c_d / is_d / cfg_d / rb_d (synthesis had folded 960 + 160 pins onto 160 + 32 flops driving W and N faces); fixed-index pk pair writes. OWNERS-S81/XR (10-18): ported onto RTL-BUILD-S81's xr (ENG collector e_*/eg_* -> xfin s, g_* gate fan-out, CTL target 1 x_mode/x_scale; +738 pins -> 8.6k) -- outline 432 x 518.4 (W face c/sw/e/g 2,850 pins on 505 um = 5.6/um, S + x_mode/x_scale/eg). XR3 (OWNERS-S81/XR2 10-18, after --cts gate 6fe7b4ea6 pin-flop spread TT 113 / FF 103 and gate ba880f813 TT 135 / FF 120 with the late flops (+80..+135 ps, 451 of 16.2k) on the S-face pin band and the SW / SE corners): c_d / rb_* / g_* single copies fanned out in ot_s81sl_slice glue (-908 pins), clk / rst_n ranged at the E-face centre, outline 345.6 x 432, explicit CTS sink clustering (size 24 / 30 um, distance_between_buffers 15, balance_levels) so the edge pin-band leaves hang off short leaf nets. XR4 (S81-SLICEP 10-18, after gate2 2cf382261 sink clustering FAIL TT 128 / FF 113, insertion 866): 16 per-region clock roots by 2-D k-means (physical/common_flow/clock_split_km.tcl, OT_CKKM_K 16: the pin-flop ring becomes 16 arcs / core masses of <= ~140 um, one BUFx24 local root at each centroid, CTS balances the roots), explicit cts_sink clustering dropped; io_hold_margin 0.025 (KITS rule 10-18). Same RTL, port, cycles, SDC. XR5 (S81-SAFE-FIX/XR1 10-19, SAFE-DESIGN CHECKLIST after the 1dd564c6f failed route; km16 gate c0a1bbe0c WARN spread 44/39, reg->reg +54.8): checklist item 3 -- every registered select that drove > ~32 data loads is now KEPT copies registered from the master's next state (rwe_c 160 ud word enables, rwr_c 40 + un_c 160 sw_d select / row-pair mux, pkw_c 32 pk pair writes, cis_c 35 ci_r select, tg1_c 2 x_eps/x_scale, lov_c 40 lo_v input-flop copies) and the x_s word select is a registered one-hot (eoh 15 / poh 5); +~490 flops, 0 data cycles. Kit: reset_landing 2 stages (rst_n port -> 2 landing flops -> ot_rst_relay; reset assert/release +2 cycles, a scheduled constant), io_hold_margin 0.03. | XR6 (S81-SAFE-FIX/XR1 10-19): 297c9bfab --cts gate TT -110.6 ps erun -> 20-term fault OR -> fault/ot_prs launch copy; fault terms registered per region (fa/fb/fc KEPT), sticky fault ORs 3 flops (+1 fault-visibility cycle, 0 data cycles). Parallel fallback kit s81sl_xr1f (FOREG=1)."
